Package: weston
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         adduser,
         kbd,
         systemd,
         libpam-runtime,
         libpam-systemd
Recommends: liberation-fonts
Suggests: weston-examples
Description: Reference implementation of a Wayland compositor
 Weston is the reference implementation of a Wayland compositor, as well
 as a useful environment in and of itself.
 .
 Out of the box, Weston provides a very basic desktop, or a full-featured
 environment for non-desktop uses such as automotive, embedded, in-flight,
 industrial, kiosks, set-top boxes and TVs. It also provides a library
 allowing other projects to build their own full-featured environments on
 top of Weston's core.
 .
 This package includes the Weston compositor with SDM backend support for
 Qualcomm platforms.

